WEBVTT

00:01:30.482 --> 00:01:33.082
We make artificial clouds all the time.

00:01:33.823 --> 00:01:37.180
These are contrails,
which are artificial water clouds

00:01:37.204 --> 00:01:39.695
that are made by the passing
of a jet engine.

00:01:40.251 --> 00:01:45.593
And so, we're already changing
the clouds on earth.

00:01:45.617 --> 00:01:46.934
By accident.

00:01:46.958 --> 00:01:51.535
Or, if you like to believe it,
by supersecret government conspiracy.

00:01:51.559 --> 00:01:53.634
(Laughter)

00:01:53.658 --> 00:01:56.783
But we are already doing this quite a lot.

00:01:56.807 --> 00:02:00.379
This is a NASA picture of shipping lanes.